---@field allowedOrigins? cloudflare.stream.EditRequestAllowedOriginsList Lists the origins allowed to display the video. Enter allowed origin domains in an array and use `*` for wildcard subdomains. Empty arrays allow the video to be viewed on any origin.
---@field creator? string A user-defined identifier for the media creator.
---@field maxDurationSeconds? number The maximum duration in seconds for a video upload. Can be set for a video that is not yet uploaded to limit its duration. Uploads that exceed the specified duration will fail during processing. A value of `-1` means the value is unknown.
