---@class cloudflare.stream.WatermarksListResultItem
---@field created? string|distilled.Null The date and a time a watermark profile was created.
---@field downloadedFrom? string|distilled.Null The source URL for a downloaded image. If the watermark profile was created via direct upload, this field is null.
---@field height? number|distilled.Null The height of the image in pixels.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null A short description of the watermark profile.
---@field opacity? number|distilled.Null The translucency of the image. A value of `0.0` makes the image completely transparent, and `1.0` makes the image completely opaque. Note that if the image is already semi-transparent, setting this to `1.0` will not make the image completely opaque.
---@field padding? number|distilled.Null The whitespace between the adjacent edges (determined by position) of the video and the image. `0.0` indicates no padding, and `1.0` indicates a fully padded video width or length, as determined by the algorithm.
---@field position? string|distilled.Null The location of the image. Valid positions are: `upperRight`, `upperLeft`, `lowerLeft`, `lowerRight`, and `center`. Note that `center` ignores the `padding` parameter.
---@field scale? number|distilled.Null The size of the image relative to the overall size of the video. This parameter will adapt to horizontal and vertical videos automatically. `0.0` indicates no scaling (use the size of the image as-is), and `1.0` fills the entire video.
---@field size? number|distilled.Null The size of the image in bytes.
---@field uid? string|distilled.Null The unique identifier for a watermark profile.
---@field width? number|distilled.Null The width of the image in pixels.

---@alias cloudflare.stream.WatermarksListResultList cloudflare.stream.WatermarksListResultItem[]

